  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Humanitarian Assistance</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Protecci&#xf3;n, Asistencia y Soluciones</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">La provisi&#xf3;n de protecci&#xf3;n, asistencia y soluciones duraderas efectivas para los refugiados, los desplazados internos (PDI) y otras v&#xed;ctimas de conflictos y desastres.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provide food and technical assistance to vulnerable rural populations and local actors to strengthen their livelihoods and make their food systems more sustainable, diverse, and resilient to climate change. Additionally, offer effective emergency response.</narrative>
  </description>
